    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/c9ca39f59b9515b5a2c4eb6ae1b0e5a7.poster.avif?t=1754455273\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/c9ca39f59b9515b5a2c4eb6ae1b0e5a7.webm?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/c9ca39f59b9515b5a2c4eb6ae1b0e5a7.mp4?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, alien explorers! We are an independent development team of 2 people. We are excited to bring you Astral hunter : Homebound, a fast-paced action RougeLike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a unique fighting style</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms and fight hordes of enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/300723968935260d399f7cdc6294381c.poster.avif?t=1754455273\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/300723968935260d399f7cdc6294381c.webm?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/300723968935260d399f7cdc6294381c.mp4?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/b2f653ad77d5eec723c1838176166f8c.poster.avif?t=1754455273\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/b2f653ad77d5eec723c1838176166f8c.webm?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/b2f653ad77d5eec723c1838176166f8c.mp4?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/50cfe4fc5f617fdce40c8bbf1a0432c6.poster.avif?t=1754455273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/50cfe4fc5f617fdce40c8bbf1a0432c6.webm?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/50cfe4fc5f617fdce40c8bbf1a0432c6.mp4?t=1754455273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies upgrade and modify your weapons or abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaknesses are also strengths: Buy items to build the attributes you need and sacrifice those that aren't good for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catching creatures, building pastures</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture creatures encountered in battle and use their abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are good and bad creatures, catch the best one!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l